  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">BIRN Hub 2024-2025</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">BIRN Hub 2024-2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Balkan Investigative Reporting Network (BIRN) Hub aims to contribute to a society that upholds demoeratic values and freedoms allowing citizens equal opportunities to make informed choices and hold governments
accountable through investigative reporting.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">The Balkan Investigative Reporting Network (BIRN) Hub syftar till att bidra till ett samh&#xe4;lle med demokratiska v&#xe4;rderingar och friheter som m&#xf6;jligg&#xf6;r lika m&#xf6;jligheter f&#xf6;r medborgare att fatta informerade beslut och att h&#xe5;lla sina regeringar ansvariga genom unders&#xf6;kande journalistik.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Society upholds democratic values and freedoms allowing citizens equal opportunities to make informed choices and hold governments accountable.

Outcome objectives:
1. Access to accurate information increased and people in power kept accountable
2. Democratic processes strengthened and public enabled to make informed decisions, demand or influence change
3. Media and CSOs transformed and empowered with skills and knowledge to effectively address public interest
4. BIRN&apos;s journalistic archive and tools systemized and made available for further examination, advocacy and learning
5. BIRN grew into a learning and knowledge sharing organisation promoting high-quality journalism production and good governance</narrative>
  </description>
